{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_1", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:00Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Hey Tim, nice to meet you! What's up? Anything new happening?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_2", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:01Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hey John! Great to meet you. Been discussing collaborations for a Harry Potter fan project I am working on - super excited! Anything interesting happening for you?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_3", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:02Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "That's great! I just signed with a new team - excited for the season!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_4", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:03Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Woohoo! Congrats on the new team. Which team did you sign with?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
