{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_8", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:07Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Cool! Have any goals in mind?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_9", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:08Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, my goal is to improve my shooting percentage. Been practicing hard and gonna make it happen.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_10", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:09Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Sounds good! What challenges have you encountered during your pre-season training?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_11", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:10Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Fitting into the new team's style of play was a challenge during pre-season.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
