{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_13", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:12Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Things are going well! The team has been really nice and I'm having fun. How's your fan project coming along?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_14", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:13Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "It's been going well! Last week I talked to my friend who is a fan of Harry Potter and we're figuring out ideas, so it's been great to get lost in that magical world!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_15", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:14Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "That's great! Loving it when people are passionate about their work. What kind of collaborations are you involved in for the fan project? I love talking to people about my sneaker collection.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_16", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:15Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! We'll be discussing various aspects of the Harry Potter universe, like characters, spells, and magical creatures. It's great to see fans coming together for this.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_17", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:16Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! Have you been to any places related to it?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_18", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:17Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_19", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:18Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "No, but it sounds fun! Going to those places is definitely on my to-do list.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d1_20", "timestamp": "2023-05-21T19:48:19Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Definitely add it to your list! It's a really fun experience. Let me know if you need any tips for visiting. Bye!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d2_1", "timestamp": "2023-06-15T17:08:00Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Last night I joined a fantasy literature forum and had a great talk about my fave books. It was so enriching!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d2_2", "timestamp": "2023-06-15T17:08:01Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Wow, great to hear that you had a blast talking books! It's cool to connect with others who share your passion. On a different note, exciting things are happening--I'm exploring endorsement opportunities. Thinking about the possibilities pumps me up. It would be amazing to work with brands and do something special. It's so rewarding to have my hard work pay off like this.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
