{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d2_6", "timestamp": "2023-06-15T17:08:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! Exciting times ahead! I'll keep you updated on which brands I choose. Can't wait to see where this journey leads me. Thanks for your support.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
