{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_1", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:00Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hey John! How've you been? Something awesome happened - I'm writing articles about fantasy novels for an online mag. It's so rewarding!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_2", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:01Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Hey Tim! Congrats on the opportunity to write about what you're into! How did it happen?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_3", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:02Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I found this opportunity on a fantasy lit forum and thought it'd be perfect since I love fantasy. I shared my ideas with the magazine and they liked them! It's been awesome to spread my love of fantasy.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_4", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:03Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Congratulations! That's awesome. What kind of articles have you been writing?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_5", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:04Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I've been writing about different fantasy novels, studying characters, themes, and making book recommendations.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_6", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Awesome! Must be so rewarding to delve into your books and chat about them. Do you have any favorite books you love writing about?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_7", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:06Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "For sure! Harry Potter and Game of Thrones are amazing - I'm totally hooked! I could chat about them forever!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_8", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:07Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Oh yeah, I remember you telling me about Harry Potter! I've got a funny story. Anthony and I went to this charity thing and ended up in this intense Harry Potter trivia contest. We did alright, but there was this one super-nerd there that took home this as a prize.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_9", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:08Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That looks great! The signature is sweet! Have you been reading anything?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_10", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:09Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "I've been reading this inspiring book, it reminds me to keep dreaming.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_11", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:10Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Books can really inspire and help us keep our dreams alive. Keep it up!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_12", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:11Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! They really do. I want to keep reaching for new goals.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_13", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:12Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Same here!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_14", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:13Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Have fun with your writing! Catch you later!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d4_15", "timestamp": "2023-08-02T16:17:14Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I'll enjoy writing them. Take care and talk soon!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_1", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:00Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hey John! Long time no see! Been super busy lately. Guess what? Just skyped with that Harry Potter fan I met in CA and had a great time. We talked characters and maybe collab-ing - so cool to talk to someone who gets it. You? Anything new going on?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_2", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:01Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Hi Tim! Nice to hear from you. Glad you could reconnect. As for me, lots of stuff happened since we last talked. Last week I had a crazy game - crazy intense! We won it by a tight score. Scoring that last basket and hearing the crowd cheer was awesome!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_3", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:02Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Nice work! Bet it felt awesome to score that basket and have the crowd going wild. Must have been such an adrenaline rush! Did you manage to capture any other photos from the game?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_4", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:03Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! It was an amazing rush and just the one I showed you. We were so hyped!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_5", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:04Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Awesome! Winning a tough game must have been such an exhilarating experience!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_6", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Our team bond is awesome and it makes all the hard work worth it.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_7", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:06Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "It's incredible how a team creates such strong ties. Having support like that is so important.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_8", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:07Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! You nailed it! Having a strong team/support is key - it's like a family away from home. We push each other to improve, and I'm so thankful for them.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_9", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:08Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That's great! Having a supportive team who are like family is awesome. Having people who motivate you and stick by you is priceless.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_10", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:09Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Definitely! They encourage me when I'm down too. It's not just in my sport, but in other aspects of life too. We hang out a lot and it's great having that bond.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_11", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:10Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, having another family is great. It definitely helps with my home life and hobbies.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_12", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:11Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Having someone to support and motivate you is so important, whether it's in sports or any other aspect of life. I know you've found your peace in reading fantasy books - that's amazing! What book are you currently reading? Anything that has stood out to you?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_13", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:12Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks for asking! I'm reading a fantasy book that really captivates me. It takes me to another world where I'm on the edge of my seat and my imagination soars. It's amazing how books can transport us like that.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_14", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:13Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Books can be so captivating, taking us on such incredible journeys! What's the name of it?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_15", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:14Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "It's a book by Patrick Rothfuss and it's awesome! The way the author builds the world and characters is amazing. You should read it!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_16", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:15Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Sounds cool! I'll definitely check it out. Thanks for the recommendation!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_17", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:16Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "No problem! Let me know what you think after you read it.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_18", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:17Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yep, I'll let you know once I'm done reading it. Thanks!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d5_19", "timestamp": "2023-08-09T10:29:18Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I hope you like it. Chat soon!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
