{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_9", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:08Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! They signed it to show our friendship and appreciation. It's a great reminder of our bond.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_10", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:09Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That's really cool. It's great that you have something to remind you of your friends. Keeping a bit of their energy and support with you is always nice.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_11", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:10Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Having something like this ball to remind me of the bond and support from my teammates is really comforting. It's a nice reminder of why I started playing basketball and my journey. It motivates me to stay strong and give it my all.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_12", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:11Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That's so sweet. It's great to have something so meaningful to keep you motivated. I'll keep that in mind next time I need a push to reach my goals.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_13", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:12Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "It's really motivating to have something that reminds you of why you started, and having supportive people around is like having a cheer team that helps you through tough times.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_14", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:13Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, that's true. Having them there to cheer you on can be a powerful source of strength.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d7_15", "timestamp": "2023-08-17T19:54:14Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, having that support really encourages me to give it my all and never give up. It's an awesome feeling!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
