{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_2", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:01Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hey John! Great to hear from you. Been busy with things, how about you?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_3", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:02Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, something cool happened! I attended a local restaurant with some new teammates last week. It was great getting to know them better.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_4", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:03Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Good support is essential. How do you feel about them?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_5", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:04Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "They're great friends. We connected over our shared love for basketball and had a ton of fun.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_6", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:05Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Sounds awesome. Having friends who share your hobbies can be really fun. Any exciting plans with them?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_7", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:06Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "We're planning to take a team trip next month to explore a new city and have some fun. Can't wait!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_8", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:07Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That sounds great! Exploring new cities is always so much fun. Where are you headed?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
