{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_10", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:09Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Edinburgh, Scotland would be great for a magical vibe. It's the birthplace of Harry Potter and has awesome history and architecture. Plus, it's a beautiful city. What do you think?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d11_11", "timestamp": "2023-09-21T20:17:10Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "That sounds like a great idea! I haven't been to Edinburgh yet, but it definitely sounds like a place worth considering for our trip. Thanks for the suggestion!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
