{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_4", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:03Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! We were lucky to find a lovely greenhouse venue for a smaller, more intimate gathering. We made sure to follow the necessary safety protocols and ensure that everyone felt safe. It was wonderful to have our loved ones celebrate with us.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
