{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_6", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah! Such a great day! It was so beautiful having everyone celebrating with us. I'd never felt so much love and happiness before. Some of my hiking club friends came even though I just joined!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_7", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:06Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! Your wedding day must've been so special. Love sure does bring us joy, huh? Any favorite memories from the big day?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_8", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:07Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Oh yeah! Picking a favorite memory was tough, but seeing her walking down the aisle, her face lit up and it got me all choked up. What a magical moment - one I'll always remember.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_9", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:08Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I bet that moment was unreal! One moment can make such an impression. I saw your photo of you two dancing, it must have been incredible. Wanna tell me more?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_10", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:09Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "That dance was great! We had our first dance at a cozy restaurant. It was so dreamy with the music and candlelight. We were so lucky to have everyone with us!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
