{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_12", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:11Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! It was a great day. Having everyone there made it extra special. It's moments like these that bring love and joy.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_13", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:12Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Congrats again! Love is truly magical and brings so much joy. I'm so happy for you and your new wife!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_14", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:13Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks so much! Your words mean a lot. I'm lucky to have you in my life, bringing so much love and joy.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_15", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:14Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks. Your friendship means a lot to me. I'm here for you anytime. I also wanted to share this bookshelf with you. It's filled with my favorite fantasy novels.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
