{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_18", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:17Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "That's great Tim! Books and movies make us escape to different places. I like to collect jerseys.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
