{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_20", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:19Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! The Wolves are my team for sure. And LeBron is the man - love his skills and leadership.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
