{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_24", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:23Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, I've had the chance to meet him a few times. He's real chill and it was a wild experience. I also had the opportunity to see him play live. It was tough, but I learned a lot from watching a top player like him.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
