{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d12_26", "timestamp": "2023-10-02T15:00:25Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "It was so amazing! The energy was crazy and everyone was so hyped. Seeing the top players was so motivating - it made me want to work even harder. Check out this pic from the game!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
