{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_1", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:00Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Hey Tim! Long time no talk - a lot has been going on since then!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_2", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:01Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hey John! Long time no see! Can't wait to catch up and hear all about what you've been up to.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_3", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:02Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Seems like forever since we caught up! I'm now mentoring the younger players on my team. It's super rewarding and I'm loving sharing my skills and knowledge with them. It's also a great way for me to stay involved in the game during the off-season.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_4", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:03Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! Mentoring must be so rewarding. You get to show others what you know - that's awesome! Is it difficult? Any hiccups?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_5", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:04Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "There are challenges, since everyone is so different. But it's been awesome gaining experience and adapting, motivating and encouraging everyone. It's been great to watch each of them develop and reach their goals - such a reward!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_6", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:05Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow, that's awesome! It must be really rewarding to see them reach their goals. What's it like mentoring them?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_7", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:06Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Mentoring them has been awesome! Seeing their growth, improvement, and confidence is so fulfilling. I'm glad I could make a positive impact on their lives. Here's a pic of me and some of the younger players at a recent practice.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_8", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:07Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "You're really doing great with them. Do any of them see you as a mentor?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_9", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:08Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Some of them do see me as a mentor, which is really rewarding. I try to provide them with advice and support on and off the court. Being a positive role model for them is something I enjoy.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_10", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:09Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That's incredible! How does it feel to have their trust and admiration? It must be such an honor to be a positive role model for them.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_11", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:10Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "It feels great to have their trust and admiration. Being a role model for these young athletes is so fulfilling. I'm glad my experiences can help shape their future and inspire them to go after their dreams.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
