{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_14", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:13Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I took this pic last summer. Seeing it was so stunning. Thanks for appreciating it. It means a lot to me.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_15", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:14Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Where did you capture this? Nature is truly amazing, isn't it?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_16", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:15Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I snapped that pic on my trip to the Smoky Mountains last year. It was incredible seeing it in person. Nature's really something else!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d14_17", "timestamp": "2023-10-17T13:50:16Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, it's amazing how nature's beauty and grandeur can take our breath away. It's so nice to escape the noise of the city and relax in nature. Good for you to get to enjoy that stunning view!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
