{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d15_21", "timestamp": "2023-10-21T17:51:20Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That's key, having a strong support network can really help with what we're trying to do. Do you have people you can lean on outside of sports?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d15_22", "timestamp": "2023-10-21T17:51:21Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, I'm lucky - I have people who are super supportive, always there for me no matter what.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d15_23", "timestamp": "2023-10-21T17:51:22Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Awesome! Having people who lift us up is essential. I'm grateful I have friends and family who support me - it's huge.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
