{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d15_25", "timestamp": "2023-10-21T17:51:24Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow, look at this great group! Are these your people?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d15_26", "timestamp": "2023-10-21T17:51:25Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, definitely! That's my fam hanging out. Being with them brings me so much happiness and helps me remember what's important. My team is like my second family too.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
