{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_1", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:00Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Hi John, how's it going? Interesting things have happened since we last talked - I joined a group of globetrotters who are into the same stuff as me. It's been awesome getting to know them and hear about their trips.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_2", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:01Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Hey Tim! Cool to hear about your globetrotting group! Must be great connecting with other traveling buffs. By the way, have you been to Italy? I had a blast there last month.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_3", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:02Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "It's been awesome chatting with fellow travel enthusiasts. Italy is definitely on my list of places to visit. How was your trip there last month?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_4", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:03Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Italy was awesome! Everything from the food to the history and architecture was amazing. I even got this awesome book while I was there and it's been giving me some cooking inspiration.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_5", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:04Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow, traveling is amazing, isn't it? I'm learning German now - tough but fun. Do you know any other languages?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_6", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! Impressive you're learning German. I know a bit of it myself and Spanish, it makes travel so much easier. How's it going with your language studies?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
