{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_9", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:08Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, knowing another language opens up a lot of opportunities. Have you come across any good resources for learning Spanish? I've been using this app.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_10", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:09Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah! I've been using that app on my phone to practice too! It's helped a lot.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_11", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:10Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "That app is great. Learning another language is tough, but the rewards are totally worth it.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_12", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:11Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "It takes dedication and practice, but it's so rewarding to communicate with different cultures. Keep it up with German!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_13", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:12Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I appreciate your encouragement. I'm definitely going to keep up with my German lessons. Do you still play basketball often?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
