{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_15", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:14Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! Love the way you go for it. Don't ever quit on what you love. I will always love reading, personally.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
