{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d27_24", "timestamp": "2024-01-02T17:26:23Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I've watched a bunch of them and they're inspiring. My favorite character is Aragorn, he grows so much throughout the story.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
