{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_6", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:05Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! It felt crazy. It's not just about the signing, but it's about feeling like all the hard work paid off - like all those training hours weren't for nothing.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_7", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:06Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Wow! I bet you were thrilled when everything finally worked out. That sense of accomplishment is awesome and really boosts your self-esteem. I can imagine all the hard work you put into it was definitely worth it.", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_8", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:07Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Yeah, it's great when you reach a goal and it feels rewarding. It's a reminder that you're going in the right direction, and all the hard work was worth it. What's something you feel proud of recently?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_9", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:08Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "I'm proud of researching visa requirements for countries I want to visit. It feels like taking initiative is a step towards making my travel dreams a reality!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_10", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:09Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Great going! Taking initiative is a must if you wanna achieve your goals. I'm excited to hear about all your future adventures!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_11", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:10Z", "speaker": "Tim", "type": "text", "body": "Thanks! I'll keep you in the loop about my travels. Is there anywhere you recommend visiting?", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
{"id": "locomo_conv_43_d29_12", "timestamp": "2024-01-12T13:41:11Z", "speaker": "John", "type": "text", "body": "Barcelona is a must-visit city! You'll love exploring the culture, admiring the architecture, and tasting the amazing food in each neighborhood. Plus, the nearby beaches are great for soaking up the sun. Definitely add it to your travel list!", "metadata": {"document_id": "locomo_conv_43", "document_title": "LoCoMo conv-43"}}
